<project label="unit2-selection-project-parking-fee-calculator">
    <title>Smart Parking Fee Calculator</title>
  <statement>
    <p>
Create a Python program that determines a customer's parking fee based on information they provide. 
Your program should make decisions using Boolean expressions and display a personalized receipt. 
Be sure to format all dollar amounts in the receipt to two decimal places in <c>print</c> using 
<c>format(num, ".2f")</c>. (You will need to use format to get all the points for this project.)
    </p>
</statement>
